WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:20.236
Bobby wiped the sweat off his forehead.

2
00:00:20.237 --> 00:00:24.105
It was only nine o'clock, but it was already hot.

3
00:00:24.106 --> 00:00:25.975
He didn't mind.

4
00:00:25.976 --> 00:00:29.098
Today was Three-Legged Race Day!

5
00:00:29.099 --> 00:00:33.697
The Kids Central campers were having three-legged races this morning.

6
00:00:33.698 --> 00:00:37.642
They were taking turns being partners with each other.

7
00:00:37.643 --> 00:00:41.963
At the end of the day, they'd see which team ran fastest.

8
00:00:41.964 --> 00:00:47.975
That team would win the blue ribbon!

9
00:00:47.976 --> 00:00:51.581
The five campers gathered on the soccer field.

10
00:00:51.582 --> 00:00:57.594
"Please choose a partner for your first race," Mr. Dunn called.

11
00:00:57.595 --> 00:01:00.884
"Want to be partners?" Ethan asked Bobby.

12
00:01:00.885 --> 00:01:03.716
"Sure!" said Bobby.

13
00:01:03.717 --> 00:01:07.780
He knew Ethan would be a fast partner.

14
00:01:07.781 --> 00:01:12.132
Bobby and Ethan tied their inside legs together with a scarf.

15
00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:15.085
"Practice walking first.

16
00:01:15.086 --> 00:01:18.671
Then try running," Mr. Dunn suggested.

17
00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:23.858
Bobby was a little taller than Ethan, but it was easy to walk together.

18
00:01:23.859 --> 00:01:26.690
"Ready?" Mr. Dunn asked.

19
00:01:26.691 --> 00:01:29.069
The kids lined up.

20
00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.529
Bobby and Ethan were racing against Nina and Izzie.

21
00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:39.041
"On your mark, get set, go!"

22
00:01:39.042 --> 00:01:42.872
"One, two. One, two. One, two,"

23
00:01:42.873 --> 00:01:48.227
Bobby and Ethan chanted as they easily ran ahead of the girls.

24
00:01:48.228 --> 00:01:56.829
"With a time of 32 seconds, the winners are Bobby and Ethan!" Mr. Dunn called.

25
00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.565
Next Bobby teamed up with Jason.

26
00:01:59.566 --> 00:02:02.513
They raced against Nina and Ethan.

27
00:02:02.514 --> 00:02:06.103
But Bobby and Jason tripped a lot.

28
00:02:06.104 --> 00:02:14.516
"With a time of 34 seconds, the winners are Nina and Ethan!" Mr. Dunn announced.

29
00:02:14.517 --> 00:02:18.431
In the third race, Bobby was partners with Nina.

30
00:02:18.432 --> 00:02:20.953
But she was a lot shorter than him.

31
00:02:20.954 --> 00:02:27.887
And they couldn't stop falling!

32
00:02:27.888 --> 00:02:35.550
"With a time of 36 seconds, the winners are Jason and Izzie!

33
00:02:35.551 --> 00:02:38.322
There are just two more races.

34
00:02:38.323 --> 00:02:42.507
Can anyone beat Bobby and Ethan's record of 32 seconds?"

35
00:02:42.508 --> 00:02:45.934
Mr. Dunn challenged the campers.

36
00:02:45.935 --> 00:02:49.003
"I bet I can," Izzie said.

37
00:02:49.004 --> 00:02:54.233
"Let's be partners!" Bobby said to Izzie.

38
00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:57.419
They quickly tied their legs together.

39
00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.503
"We can beat you,"

40
00:02:58.504 --> 00:03:01.996
said Ethan, who was paired up with Jason.

41
00:03:01.997 --> 00:03:04.661
"Jason and I are almost the same height.

42
00:03:04.662 --> 00:03:07.285
So we're going to be fast."

43
00:03:07.286 --> 00:03:10.213
Ethan was right about being fast.

44
00:03:10.214 --> 00:03:16.468
As soon as Mr. Dunn said "Go!" the two boys shot ahead.

45
00:03:16.469 --> 00:03:24.234
"One, two. One, two. One, two. One, two," Izzie and Bobby grunted.

46
00:03:24.235 --> 00:03:27.176
They went faster and faster.

47
00:03:27.177 --> 00:03:31.311
Izzie and Bobby fell down just as they crossed the finish line.

48
00:03:31.312 --> 00:03:39.622
"With a time of 31 seconds, Izzie and Bobby have become the fastest pair!" Mr. Dunn cried.

49
00:03:39.623 --> 00:03:44.968
Bobby wiped grass off his T-shirt and grinned at Izzie.

50
00:03:44.969 --> 00:03:47.796
"Only one more race to go.

51
00:03:47.797 --> 00:03:54.821
Nina and Jason versus Izzie and Ethan," said Mr. Dunn.

52
00:03:54.822 --> 00:03:58.056
"Oh no. I still have another race!"

53
00:03:58.057 --> 00:04:01.503
Izzie said, trying to catch her breath.

54
00:04:01.504 --> 00:04:05.309
Bobby watched nervously as the racers lined up.

55
00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:13.214
"On your mark, get set, go!" Mr. Dunn called.

56
00:04:13.215 --> 00:04:19.167
Nina and Jason stumbled while Izzie and Ethan zoomed ahead.

57
00:04:19.168 --> 00:04:22.984
Were they fast enough to beat Bobby and Izzie's time?

58
00:04:22.985 --> 00:04:29.301
"With a time of 32 seconds, Izzie and Ethan do not beat the record.

59
00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:36.306
The winners are Izzie and Bobby!" Mr. Dunn announced.

60
00:04:36.307 --> 00:04:40.823
"You are the fastest girl I know," Bobby said.

61
00:04:40.824 --> 00:04:42.815
Izzie grinned.

62
00:04:42.816 --> 00:04:54.189
"Thanks. Now let's race to get our blue ribbons!"

63
00:04:54.190 --> 00:05:05.749
[caption_out@
